pc98door 1.0.0 for EleBBS
PC-9801 menu for a local terminal
64-bit Linux build of the disk menu
Games run on the 32-bit Windows build
This build has no Neko Project core
Starting a disk reports that fact
bios, roms, and save sit beside the program
Firmware and disk images are not included
GPL-2.0-or-later, Martin Kazmaier 2026
